sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as Platform Ingress<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>Auth Enforcement
    participant Istio as Istio Sidecar<br/>mTLS STRICT
    participant VLLM as vllm-rocm Pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant GPU as AMD ROCm GPU
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>(S3/PVC/OCI)

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1: Model Inference Request

    Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Ingress->>KRBAC: Forward request<br/>Validate auth
    KRBAC->>Istio: Authorized request<br/>mTLS
    Istio->>VLLM: HTTP/8000<br/>mTLS envelope stripped
    VLLM->>GPU: Inference computation<br/>ROCm runtime
    GPU-->>VLLM: Token generation result
    VLLM-->>Istio: JSON Response
    Istio-->>KRBAC: mTLS response
    KRBAC-->>Ingress: Forward response
    Ingress-->>Client: HTTPS Response<br/>TLS 1.2+

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 2: Model Loading at Startup

    VLLM->>Storage: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS/TLS 1.2+ or NFS
    Storage-->>VLLM: Model artifacts
    VLLM->>GPU: Load model to GPU memory<br/>ROCm memory transfer
    Note over VLLM,GPU: Model ready for inference
